<title>PORTUGAL: WestLB issues 10 bln escudis debt.</title>
<headline>WestLB issues 10 bln escudis debt.</headline>
<text>
<p>ISSUER: WestLB Finance Curacao.</p>
<p>GUARANTOR: Westdeutsche Landesbank Girozentrale (WestLB)</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 10 billion escudos</p>
<p>MATURITY: 28 August 2007 (10 years - subject to call option)</p>
<p>LIQUIDATION DATE: August 28 1997</p>
<p>ISSUE PRICE: 100.00 percent</p>
<p>CALL OPTION: At par</p>
<p>ADMISSION TO LISTING: Luxembourg bourse</p>
<p>DENOMINATION: 1,000 PTE</p>
<p>INTEREST RATE: 6.2 percent in first year; rising by 0.1 percentage point each year thereafter until maturity</p>
<p>DATE OF PAYMENT OF INTEREST: August 28 each year STATUS: Senior and pari passu</p>
<p>LAW APPLICABLE: German</p>
<p>LEAD MANAGER AND BOOKRUNNER: Banco Cisf (bookrunner) and Caixa Geral de Depositos</p>
<p>PORTUGUESE PAYING AGENT: Banco Comercial Portugues</p>
</text>
